int get_hit_damage(plid pid, unsigned type) ->
Returns the amount of damage <var>pid</var> should do to another player given a type.
Possible values of <var>type</var> are:
<dl>
<dt>0<dd>Gun, torso
<dt>1<dd>Gun, head
<dt>2<dd>Gun, arms
<dt>3<dd>Gun, legs
<dt>4<dd>Spade
</dl>

void after_player_destroy(plid pid) ->
Called after <var>pid</var> is made not alive.
Called by kill() and boot_players_to_limbo().

void boot_players_to_limbo(void) ->
Makes all players un-joined. Sets the score of all teams to 0.
Only call this during or right before map load if you want things to stay consistent across the network.

